  "prefLabel": "Tax 210.10 Hearing Record",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 210.10 Hearing Record. The board shall cause an accurate record of the hearing to be made in accordance with RSA 498-A:20 and RSA 541-A:31, VII.\n\nSource. #5638, eff 9-1-93; amd by #6762, eff 7-1-98; amd by #7068, INTERIM, eff 8-15-99, EXPIRES, 12-13-99; ss by #7153, eff 12-10-99; ss by #8987-A, eff 9-24-07; ss by #9538, eff 9-8-09; ss by #10625-B, eff 6-26-14; ss by #13711-B, eff 8-2-23",
